    "transcript_tail": [
      {
        "narration": "The scene settles after the action.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I travel to the old north watchpost to follow Veska's courier trail.",
        "turn": 89,
        "turn_index": 89
      },
      {
        "narration": "The crumbling stone of the old north watchpost yields its secrets to your careful gaze. Dust motes dance in the weak sunlight filtering through broken crenellations as you meticulously scan the perimeter and interior pathways. You successfully locate faded courier markings, distinct traces of Sable Chain sigils, and a clear set of prints matching Veska's known stride near the eastern gate.\n\nAction: Signs found at watchpost.,\"npc\":{\"speaker\":\"(Self/Scene)\",\"line\":\"The old north watchpost yields several signs indicating recent passage by couriers, distinct Sable Chain markings, and clear traces of Handler Veska's trail.\"},\n\"reward\":\"Observation complete; key evidence gathered.\",\"followup_hooks\":[],\"semantic_intent_candidates\":[{\"intent\":\"investigation\",\"summary\":\"Discovery of courier marks, Sable Chain signs, and Veska's trail at the watchpost.\",\"confidence\":0.95}],\"relationship_delta_candidates\":[{\"target\":\"(Self/Observer)\",\"axis\":\"curiosity\",\"delta\":+1,\"summary\":\"Increased curiosity due to confirmed presence of key figures/marks.\"\\}],\"memory_candidates\":[{\"owner\":\"Bran\",\"summary\":\"You successfully confirmed the passage of couriers and Veska's trail at the north watchpost.\",\"importance\":0.7}],\"world_signal_candidates\":[{\"kind\":\"Evidence Discovery\",\"summary\":\"The North Watchpost is a point of recent activity for Sable Chain operatives/couriers.\"\\}],\"future_hook_candidates\":[{\"kind\":\"Immediate Investigation\",\"summary\":\"Following the path traced by Veska's trail from the watchpost might lead to her immediate destination or staging area.\",\"turn_index\":100}]}",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I inspect the old north watchpost for courier signs, Sable Chain marks, and Veska's trail.",
        "turn": 90,
        "turn_index": 90
      },
      {
        "narration": "You successfully move into position just as the courier reaches the outer threshold of the old north watchpost. The messenger hesitates, clearly ready to hand over sealed documents before turning down the dusty road leading out towards the wilds. You now have a chance to secure the package or question the bearer directly regarding its contents and origin.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I intercept Veska's courier before the message can leave the old north watchpost.",
        "turn": 91,
        "turn_index": 91
      },
      {
        "narration": "The tightly folded parchment, bearing the distinctive seal of Handler Veska, felt crisp and official in your grip. The coded script within is immediately recognizable as tactical dispatch language. You have successfully retrieved a vital piece of intelligence from the discarded belongings of the intercepted courier.\n\nAction: Coded Message Recovered",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I recover Veska's coded message from the intercepted courier.",
        "turn": 92,
        "turn_index": 92
      },
      {
        "narration": "The complex cipher on Veska's parchment yields instantly under your focused scrutiny. The symbols resolve into a clear, terse directive detailing the Sable Chain leadership's intended movement towards the Western Pass.\n\nThis intelligence confirms rumors of a major consolidation effort and gives you a precise target for tracking them down. It feels like a direct line to their current strategic objectives.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I decode Veska's coded message to learn where the Sable Chain leadership is moving.",
        "turn": 93,
        "turn_index": 93
      },
      {
        "narration": "Your careful passage across the uneven terrain allowed you to slip into the perimeter of the ridge hideout without disturbing a single stone. The air here is crisp and carries the faint scent of woodsmoke mixed with damp earth, confirming this location is actively used by Veska's faction. You arrive quietly at the edge of the camp, perfectly positioned to observe their operations before they can scatter or relocate further down the ridge line.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I travel to the ridge hideout before Veska's leadership cell can relocate.",
        "turn": 94,
        "turn_index": 94
      },
      {
        "narration": "The ridge crest offers a commanding view over the hidden compound. You successfully detect two pairs of guards patrolling the main perimeter, and a discreet service exit is visible near the eastern wall. Furthermore, you spot Handler Veska herself—she is directing movement near a supply wagon, confirming her active involvement in preparations.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I scout the ridge hideout for guards, exits, and signs of Handler Veska.",
        "turn": 95,
        "turn_index": 95
      },
      {
        "narration": "The ridge hideout falls silent as you step forward, the damning proof held firmly in your hand. Handler Veska, who had been surveying the western pass with a practiced air of weary command, finally turns her attention to you. She studies the document—or evidence—with an unnervingly steady gaze before any words leave her lips. The tension snaps taut between you two on this exposed ridge overlooking the Sable Chain territory.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I confront Handler Veska at the ridge hideout with the proof linking her to the Sable Chain route pressure.",
        "turn": 96,
        "turn_index": 96
      },
      {
        "narration": "The moment responds without producing a major new consequence.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I secure Veska's leadership ledgers before the Sable Chain can destroy or move them.",
        "turn": 97,
        "turn_index": 97
      },
      {
        "narration": "The moment responds without producing a major new consequence.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I return to Bran and Garran with Veska's leadership ledgers and proof of the Sable Chain command structure.",
        "turn": 98,
        "turn_index": 98
      },
      {
        "narration": "The moment responds without producing a major new consequence.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I review Veska's ledgers with Bran and Garran to map the Sable Chain command structure.",
        "turn": 99,
        "turn_index": 99
      },
      {
        "narration": "The moment responds without producing a major new consequence.",
        "objective_progression": {},
        "player_action": "I study the ledger entries to identify the hidden Sable Chain paymaster.",
        "turn": 100,
        "turn_index": 100
      }
